<InfoLayout
    title="About Tondo"
    description="Tondo gives a person or a team one address for a page of links with a designed look."
>
    <p>
        Tondo gives a person or a team one address, such as tondo.page/maya, for a page of links
        with a designed look. You add your links, choose a look and share the address. Tondo takes
        care of the design.
    </p>
    <p>
        A tondo is a circular painting. That's where the name comes from, and it's why every look
        starts with one.
    </p>
    <p>Tondo is still being built, so some of what's shown on this site isn't available yet.</p>
</InfoLayout>
